+# Knowledge pack
+
+Published document reads for other contexts go through `Knowledge::Catalog.list(tenant_id:)`
+in `app/public`. Models and persistence stay private to this pack.
+
+## Rollback
+
+To undo the pack extraction without changing the database, move files back under the root
+`app/` tree, remove `packs/knowledge`, and restore the root `package.yml` dependency list.
+No migration or data conversion is required for rollback.
